<title>SOUTH AFRICA: S.Africa money mkt shortage rises to 7.76 bln rand.</title>
<headline>S.Africa money mkt shortage rises to 7.76 bln rand.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The South African Reserve Bank said the money market shortage rose to 7.757 billion rand on Monday from 7.360 billion rand on Saturday.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom, +27 11 482-1003</p>
